SUMMARY:Opening Convocation
DESCRIPTION:Please note that Convocation has been moved from Monday\, August 24\, to Tuesday\, August 25\, at 11 a.m. \nWe look forward to having our campus community come together in Moore Auditorium as we officially mark the beginning of a new academic year. \nWe hope you will join us for this special tradition as we welcome our students\, faculty\, and staff back to Mars Hill for another great year.
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/opening-convocation/
LOCATION:Moore Auditorium\, 79 Cascade St\, Mars Hill\, NC\, 28754\, United States
CATEGORIES:Academic Calendar,Academic Events and Lectures,Featured,Public Events,ROAR,Student Activities,Welcome Week
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.mhu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/seal-university-vector-cmyk-gold.jpg
END:VEVENT
